# Update Smart Hub Implementation Plan

This plan outlines the steps to "update" the Smart Hub project, starting with UI improvements and then moving to core functionality.

## Proposed Changes

### Fixing Typos and Branding

The name "Smaer-HUB" is used consistently across the project, which appears to be a typo for "Smart-HUB".

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///home/melwinabi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/smart-hub/src/app/page.tsx)
- Update "Smaer-HUB" to "Smart-HUB" in the header.

#### [MODIFY] [dashboard/page.tsx](file:///home/melwinabi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/smart-hub/src/app/admin/dashboard/page.tsx)
- Update "Smaer-HUB" to "Smart-HUB" in the sidebar.

#### [MODIFY] [globals.css](file:///home/melwinabi/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/smart-hub/src/app/globals.css) (if applicable)
- Check for any hardcoded brand names in styles.

### Functional Updates (Pending User Feedback)

- **Real Authentication**: implement the actual OTP login flow for admins using `nodemailer` and `OtpVerification` model.
- **Device Management**: improve the admin search to allow creating/editing devices.
- **User Dashboard**: implement a dashboard for non-admin users to see their own devices.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Run `npm run dev` and navigate to [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).
2. Verify that the header says "Smart-HUB".
3. Log in as admin and verify the sidebar says "Smart-HUB".
4. Check other pages for "Smaer" typos.
